  "description": "Swiss Ephemeris ported to idiomatic C# (.NET 10). Drop-in successor of SharpAstrology.SwissEph 0.3.0: same SwissEphemeridesService/IEphemerides surface, no native dependencies. Implements SharpAstrology.Base.IEphemerides.",
